# Agent workspace / IDE
# 2026-08-10: .claude/skills/ is now the single tracked canonical skill source (see
# omission/artifacts/.lab/agent-harness-audit-20260810.json P1 item -- .agents/skills/ was a
# stale, drifted duplicate and has been retired).
#
# 2026-08-12 harness reset: settings.json is now un-ignored too. It carries the permission
# policy (deny `git add .`/`-A`, force-push, hard reset) and is doctrine, not machine-local
# preference -- left untracked, a fresh clone silently resurrects the policy gap. settings.
# local.json stays ignored: that IS machine-local, and the copy retired in this reset was
# granting `Bash(git add *)` in direct contradiction of settings.json.
#
# 2026-08-19 jnwb/omission split: the 7 project skills moved to omission/.claude/skills/ (task-
# specific, travels with the project). This root .claude/* block only governs the root tree --
# it does not need a parallel rule for omission/.claude/, which is untouched by any pattern here
# and stays fully tracked by default. Root .claude/skills/ is reserved for future *generic jnwb*
# skills and is legitimately empty today.
.claude/
.cursor/
.vscode/
.idea/
.agents/

# Local configuration files
omission/notebooks/local_config.py

# Whitelist developer progress/plans/review JSON files
# Labyrinth graph state -- the PRP->Labyrinth migration (2026-07-28) never extended this
# whitelist to the replacement system, so the project's own knowledge graph was never
# git-tracked (found and fixed 2026-07-31, same session that found the analogous skill-
# registry gap left by the same migration).
!omission/artifacts/.lab/*.json

# scratch and build artifacts
tmp/

# Large regenerable or archival binaries. The generators are tracked; the products are not.
#   omission/context/manuscript-docx/     rebuild: omission/scripts/build_draft_docx.py (from the markdown drafts)
#   omission/context/draft-assets/        editable figure sources, kept on disk, too large for git
#   omission/context/archive/             superseded handouts, preserved on disk under Conservation
omission/context/manuscript-docx/
omission/context/draft-assets/
omission/context/archive/

# Private, controlling analysis goal (2026-08-24). Kept on disk, not tracked -- it is not public
# jnwb documentation, public API doctrine, general-purpose skill content, or manuscript prose.
# Do not promote its content into a tracked file without an explicit decision to do so.
omission/context/ANALYSIS_GOAL.md

# omission/context/figures holds the manuscript figures 01-07 and is TRACKED on purpose.
# Only the finalized per-figure deliverables are tracked; nested working directories
# (svg/, artifacts/, supplements/) hold multi-MB/GB intermediates and stay ignored.
!omission/context/figures/*.py
!omission/context/figures/*.md
!omission/context/figures/fig0*_finalized.svg
!omission/context/figures/fig0*_finalized.png
# 2026-08-2x: the finalized deliverables were moved into their own subfolder. Whitelisted
# here too so the move doesn't silently drop them from tracking (found 2026-08-27: the move
# fell outside the flat-path patterns above and the files went untracked/ignored).
!omission/context/figures/finalized/
!omission/context/figures/finalized/fig0*_finalized.svg
!omission/context/figures/finalized/fig0*_finalized.png
!omission/context/figures/fig0*_*/fig0*.svg
!omission/context/figures/fig0*_*/fig0*.png
!omission/context/figures/fig0*_*/fig0*.receipt.json
